  "code" : "public int[] nextSmallerElement(int[] nums) {\n    int n = nums.length;\n    int[] nse = new int[n];\n    Deque<Integer> stack = new ArrayDeque<>();\n    for (int i = n - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n        while (!stack.isEmpty() && stack.peek() >= nums[i]) {\n            stack.pop();\n        }\n        nse[i] = stack.isEmpty() ? -1 : stack.peek();\n        stack.push(nums[i]);\n    }\n    return nse;\n}",
